cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Promptillery: Iterative knowledge distillation from LLMs to smaller, efficient models"
abstract: >-
  A config-driven framework and CLI for distilling knowledge from large language
  models into compact, deployment-ready students. Supports iterative
  teacher-in-the-loop classifier training, pre-materialized causal-LM SFT, and
  budget-aware acquisition policies with token tracking and cost estimation.
type: software
authors:
